{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t將軍澳上村發生致命意外，一名男子死亡。<br/>\n<br/>\n警方下午近3時接獲途人報案，指將軍澳上村一名男子，懷疑用工具升起私家車維修期間，突然被私家車壓著，途人和鄰居合力將他拉出，救援人員到場急救及將他送院，其後證實不治。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:17:02.102956+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:31:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:17:33.745034+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:10:35.601371+00:00","content_hash":"445b160df19b4d8fc3fea2b35b3add2771fed5bed5d1851dbba0d9630230061d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}